                    {
                      "text": "Join punctually, thank them briefly, open with 30 seconds of concise context, and jump smoothly into thoughtful experience questions they genuinely love answering (\"What surprised you most transitioning from agency to product? What common mistake do eager juniors make in first portfolios?\"). Protect their time fiercely—watch the clock yourself and wrap cleanly at minute 14 (\"I want to honor our 15 minutes—this was gold!\").",
