                    {
                      "text": "Pick two concentrated communities where real practitioners gather—open-source issue threads, local design collectives, Slack specialty guilds, or meetup volunteer teams. Show up steadily answering beginner questions patiently, welcoming newcomers warmly, and sharing clean event notes. Reliability inside tiny trusted circles builds massive deep trust fast.",
