                      "text": "Connecting Brand Character to Form & Type",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Anchor visual choices on crisp polarities: Warm vs. Clinical, Geometric vs. Organic, Playful vs. Editorial, Heritage vs. Minimal. Sharp angular sans-serifs + high-contrast monochrome project architectural precision; warm humanist curves + earthy terracotta hues communicate tactile craft cleanly.",
