                      "title": "Applying Translating Personality Into Visual Grammar"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Noticing every eco-brand used identical leaf-green swirls, an ethical packaging studio claimed warm raw kraft + bold charcoal + sharp safety orange—owning instant shelf recognition.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Standing Out in Sea of Green",
                      "takeaway": "Visual contrast beats safe mimicry consistently."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Look closely at what clichés saturate your niche so your visual system feels unmistakably distinct cleanly.",
                      "type": "callout",
                      "title": "Audit Competitors First to Differentiate",
                      "variant": "tip"
                    },
