                      "text": "Every durable Brand Identity provides a structured Logo Suite: **Primary Horizontal Lockup**, **Stacked Vertical Variant**, and a simplified **Submark / Icon Badge** that stays crystal clear in pure 1-color Black and pure White at tiny sizes (`16–32px`), backed by strict **Clear Space** and minimum-size rules.",
