                    {
                      "text": "Open every identity presentation re-confirming the agreed strategic brief (\"Warm, accessible everyday sustainability for young urban parents\"), walk logically from Mood/Reasoning -> Monochrome Geometry -> Palette & Contrast -> Real Contextual Mockups (phone feed, signage, packaging!), so choices feel inevitable rather than personal.",
