                  "title": "Customer-As-Hero Brand Narratives",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Brand as Trusted Guide (`StoryBrand` Clarity)",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Great narrative brands cast the **Customer cleanly as the Hero** facing a frustrating obstacle, positioning your Brand humbly as the experienced **Trusted Guide** equipping them with a crisp clear plan toward genuine transformation (`\"Clear tax confidence for independent makers\"`, NOT `\"Look how clever our tax algorithms look!\"`). Every brand story centers around **what the buyer becomes or achieves** using you!",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Guide Positioning Frame",
                      "text": "Structuring brand narratives positioning the customer cleanly as central hero fighting real friction while your brand supplies calm wisdom, clear plans, and trustworthy relief as supportive guide.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Self-Centered: \"We Built Next-Gen AI Logistics Since 2021!\" Customer-As-Hero: \"Never Lose Late Afternoon Freight Again—Ship Regional Palettes on Time in 3 Clicks.\"",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Hero-Swap Headline Makeover"
                    },
