                        "Share founder origin motivation briefly ONLY where it explains WHY you fiercely protect customer interests today (`empathy + authority`).",
                        "Feature diverse authentic customer victories visibly rather than hiding solely behind corporate founder selfies!"
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Customer-As-Hero Brand Narratives"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Dedicated 80% of landing homepage copy to awards, headquarters history, and founder hobbies while burying what problem visitors could fix.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Self-Obsessed About Page",
                      "takeaway": "Centering visitor stress relief upfront lifted qualified bookings 50% instantaneously!"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Show you deeply understand their headache FIRST (`Empathy`), then flash concise proof you know how to solve it reliably (`Authority`)!",
                      "type": "callout",
                      "title": "Empathy Plus Authority Wins Guide Trust",
                      "variant": "tip"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "knowledge_check",
                      "prompt": "In enduring narrative brand positioning, who rightfully holds the central Hero role across headlines and stories?",
                      "options": [
