                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Great modern brand guidelines fit comfortably inside an accessible **living web link or crisp 4-page kit**: exact clear hex/RGB colors + clear primary/secondary fonts + clean Do/Don’t layout snaps + **real before-and-after headline/email rewrites**. Give contributors ready-to-clone Canva/Figma starter social frames and email signatures—making **\"on-brand\"** literally the easiest fast lazy path!",
