                        "Include crisp accessible color-contrast pairs (`WCAG AA verified button/text combos`) directly inside palette charts!"
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Living Brand Kits vs. 80-Page Unread PDFs"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Twelve sales reps built random unstyled mismatch decks using garish stretched clipart because clean templates lived nowhere accessible.",
