                    {
                      "text": "Strong brand equity stamps clear financial fingerprints across ordinary analytics cleanly: **Branded Search Volume (`more people typing your actual company name straight into search bars!`)**, **Direct / Word-of-Mouth Attribution (`rising \"Heard from a friend/podcast\" signup responses`)**, **Declining Paid Ad CAC over time (`familiar faces convert 2x higher on cold social ads!`)**, **Faster Sales Cycle Speed**, and **Lower Price Resistance (`holding healthy full prices against cheaper commodity rivals`)**!",
