                    {
                      "term": "Brand Demand Multiplier",
                      "text": "Measuring rising branded searches, organic direct arrivals, higher ad click-through rates, and lower discount dependency proving brand familiarity actively makes every performance campaign perform cheaper and faster!",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Track monthly Share of Branded Searches + `\"How did you hear about us?\"` peer mentions + `% of deals won without 15%+ discounting`. Rising lines together prove unmistakably that brand equity is creating pure margin power cleanly!",
