                        "Track average realized discount % over quarters—strengthening brand power steadily pushes unforced discounts down cleanly!"
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Measuring Brand Impact Without Guesswork"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Performance marketers starved brand storytelling 100% into tight bottom-funnel retargeting ads—until cold acquisition CAC tripled cleanly inside 18 months once existing aware buyers ran dry!",
