                      "text": "Evolution Over Disruption",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "As markets and tastes evolve over years, practice **Evolutionary Refresh** rather than destructive total wipes: tidy legibility on small phone avatars, expand accessible font spacing, retire stiff outdated phrases gently—WHILE locking sacred **Core Distinctive Anchors (`signature hue, clear structural promise, beloved vocal spirit`)** firmly intact so decades of cumulative public familiarity never reset cleanly back to zero!",
