                        "Retire outdated product baggage gracefully while welcoming fresh chapters cohesively inside your unified Branded House story!"
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Refining Rather Than Reinventing Winning Brands"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "A beloved heritage juice brand discarded its iconic unmistakable orange-with-straw graphic cleanly overnight onto generic minimalist stock white typography—losing 20% retail sales immediately because loyal shoppers literally couldn’t spot it sitting right in front of them on shelves!",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Disastrous Heritage Wipeout",
                      "takeaway": "Respect hard-won human visual memory always!"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Ask strangers to draw or describe your brand from memory cleanly before touching visuals—NEVER discard the exact recognizable signature they remember!",
