                    {
                      "text": "Shared Exploration Before Proposals",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Treat BD call #1 strictly as collaborative alignment: share a crisp 2-minute thesis explaining why audiences overlap cleanly, ask honest questions about their current Q3 partner priorities, compliance boundaries, and bandwidth limits (\"What made your best past partner launches work smoothly—and where did messy ones stall?\"), and leave only committing to one tiny concrete joint test.",
