                      "text": "Verifying alignment across four essentials during early calls: Audience Overlap, Cultural Speed Parity, Internal Bandwidth, and Clean Operational Ownership.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "A nimble 6-person startup pitching a massive bank integration expects a 2-week launch while bank compliance requires 9 months—spotting speed parity early avoids dead pipeline illusions!",
