                  "title": "Escaping Linear Hourly Traps via Modularization",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Packaging IP & Hybrid Retainers",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Service businesses elevate margins cleanly without dropping quality by **packaging reusable IP**: standard starter frameworks, documented checklist libraries, group workshops alongside 1:1 reviews (`1-to-Many leverage`), or maintenance/monitoring retainers keeping recurring ties smooth without reinventing custom wheels for every client.",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Hybrid Service-Product Ladder",
                      "text": "Blending high-trust customized services smoothly with reusable templates, cohort workshops, or digital assets so revenue decouples partially from pure personal billable clock hours.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "1. Self-Serve Audit Kit ($99) -> 2. Group Implementation Cohort ($600/seat, 15 seats = $9k for 12 hrs!) -> 3. Concierge Private Retainer ($3,500/mo).",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Margin Ladder Example"
                    },
