                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Notice any exact checklist, spreadsheet, or script recreated manually for three clients—turn it immediately into a clean branded reusable template!",
                        "Separate deep creative advisory (`high hourly value`) cleanly from standardized mechanical prep (`templated or delegated`).",
                        "Build low-friction ongoing maintenance tiers cleanly onto completed setup projects."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Escaping Linear Hourly Traps via Modularization"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Brilliant designer capped income at personal midnight hours rebuilding identical brand guidelines decks from blank canvases 20 times yearly.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Exhausted Custom Agency Ceiling",
                      "takeaway": "Shipping modular standardized brand-kit systems lifted hourly effective yield cleanly by 80%!"
