                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Plan intentional evolution gates rather than running accidental patchwork forever.",
                        "Grandfather loyal earliest supporters gracefully whenever lifting entry prices significantly.",
                        "Keep continuous experimentation slots dedicated inside annual roadmaps exploring emerging secondary revenue expansions!"
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Evolving the Model Smoothly Over Company Lifecycles"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Abruptly hiking loyal founding clients 300% overnight with 7 days notice triggered bitter public backlash canceling years of word-of-mouth goodwill.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Clumsy Overnight Price Shock",
                      "takeaway": "Respectful advance notice plus generous founding loyalty rates turn price migrations into celebratory retention moments!"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Giving your very first 50 paying believers warm lifetime appreciation protects authentic word-of-mouth forever for pennies!",
