                  "title": "Neutralizing Late Nibbles & Good-Cop/Bad-Cop",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Spotting Classic Negotiation Moves Calmly",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Recognize common commercial patterns cleanly: **The Nibble** (`tiny extra freebie begged after everything agreed -> counter warmly with \"Happy to bundle monthly edits neatly onto our $400 maintenance add-on, or leave current scope crisp as signed!\"`), **Higher Authority (`Good-Cop/Bad-Cop`: \"I love your price, my strict finance committee refuses!\")** (`counter: \"Let’s walk through a 1-page ROI breakdown directly together so you feel completely armed inside finance!\"`), and **Artificial Exploding Ultimatums** (`check reality gently vs. false rush!`).",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "The Last-Minute Nibble",
                      "text": "Slipping small unpriced extra deliverables (\"throw in training free?\") casually right at contract closing hoping excitement suppresses firm pricing boundaries.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "\"Glad you thought of team video training—want me to include our standard $650 workshop add-on cleanly on Addendum B before finalizing, or keep Agreement A crisp as agreed?\"",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Polite Anti-Nibble Boundary"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Notice patterns calmly (`\"Ah, classic late nibble!\"`) inside your head—naming games internally strips emotional rattle cleanly!",
                        "Counter \"Strict unseen finance boss\" cleanly by empowering them WITH hard ROI proof OR requesting direct 5-minute alignment directly with real decision-makers early!",
                        "Protect initial contract fairness—desperate miserable concessions breed resentful relationships immediately post-signature!"
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Neutralizing Late Nibbles & Good-Cop/Bad-Cop"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "A freelancer kept saying \"Sure, happy to include!\" to three \"tiny post-agreement tweaks\" consuming 25 unpaid hours and spoiling the whole relationship!",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "The Endless Scope Nibble Bleed",
                      "takeaway": "Politely quoting crisp Add-On menus instantly teaches lasting commercial respect!"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Ask smoothly Day 1: `\"Walk me through everyone involved before final ink so nobody hits surprise approvals Week 3!\"`",
                      "type": "callout",
                      "title": "Verify Real Decision Makers Early",
                      "variant": "tip"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "knowledge_check",
                      "prompt": "What polite firm counter protects margins best when a client tries a Last-Minute Nibble (\"Just throw in social banners free before I sign!\")?",
