                    {
                      "text": "The Same-Day 5-Bullet Deal Recap",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "The deal isn’t real until it’s written calmly in plain English! Within **2 hours after every negotiation call**, send a warm crisp **Written Recap Email**: (1) **Exact Agreed Scope/Deliverables**, (2) **Price & Exact Payment Milestones**, (3) **Agreed Key Dates & Who Sends What First**, (4) **Explicitly Excluded Out-of-Scope Notes**, and (5) **Next Signing Step (`\"Reply confirming this matches cleanly and I’ll fire the formal doc!\"`)**.",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Post-Call Written Recap",
                      "text": "Concise structured same-day summary confirming every agreed price, deliverable, schedule assumption, and exclusion in plain words before formal contract signatures.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "\"Great aligning just now! Quick summary ensuring zero crossed wires: 1) Core audit + 4 templates ($6,500 total), 2) 50% deposit upon signature + 50% upon Oct 20 handoff, 3) Client sends brand kit by Oct 3 (`launch date shifts 1:1 if assets delay`), 4) Paid ad buying excluded. Look accurate?\"",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Bulletproof Recap Line"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Clarify **Client Dependency Rules** upfront (`\"Timeline depends strictly on receiving feedback inside 48 business hours\"`).",
                        "Catch tiny silent misunderstandings inside polite reply emails IMMEDIATELY—never sweep blurry phrases under carpets hoping!",
                        "Archive final clean agreed email threads beside signed PDFs cleanly."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Locking Verbal Handshakes With Clean Written Recaps"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "A buyer insisted three months later `\"You totally promised lifetime free updates verbally!\"` because zero post-call recap ever documented exact Phase 1 terms cleanly.",
