                    "State upcoming milestone dates calmly",
                    "Avoid passive-aggressive reminder clichés"
                  ],
                  "objectives": [
                    "Explain value-driven follow-up craft",
                    "Apply polite follow-ups & alignment escalations in original drafts"
                  ],
                  "est_minutes": 28,
                  "is_required": true,
                  "introduction": "Silent delays stall cross-company workflows, yet irritable nudges (\"Per my last email\") burn relationship warmth.",
                  "further_reading": [
                    {
