                    {
                      "text": "Never trust a `user_id` sent in a request body or URL parameter for authorization. Derive the acting identity strictly from the verified session (`auth.uid()`), enforce row ownership in both API/RPC checks and database RLS, and block self-approval on reviews (`submission.user_id !== reviewer_id`).",
