                    {
                      "text": "High-performing teams align around what measurable user shift signals success—not merely checking off disconnected tickets. Starting every project with a 15-minute shared outcome check (\"By Nov 30, new learners finish lesson 1 cleanly in under 10 minutes without support pings\") keeps diverse specialists harmonizing choices spontaneously.",
