                    {
                      "text": "Confusion over who executes versus who merely gives input causes endless resentment. Using lightweight RACI (Responsible: does work, Accountable: single final sign-off owner, Consulted: gives pre-decision input, Informed: updated post-decision) speeds decisions cleanly—provided every deliverable assigns strictly ONE Accountable owner.",
