                    {
                      "text": "True delegation transfers both the goal and real authority within explicit safety boundaries: describe why the task matters, clear \"done\" criteria, firm budget/time limits, known watchouts, and exact check-in dates—then step back gracefully while letting the owner pick how to execute.",
                      "type": "paragraph"
