                      "title": "Balanced Delegation Hand-Off"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Clarify exact authority tier: decide solo, decide & inform, or recommend first.",
                        "Explain strategic why so owner builds judgment.",
                        "Resist rewriting minor style preferences unless objective quality drops."
