                      "text": "If bringing a missed estimate triggers shouting, teams quietly learn to hide risks until crisis erupts on launch day. Great teammates welcome red flags warmly (\"Thanks for flagging Friday's QA risk on Tuesday morning—let's trim scope cleanly now\") so collective agility beats late-stage panic.",
