                      "text": "Assume every colleague worked intelligently given what they knew then—hunt broken workflow conditions, never human scapegoats. Collect Start/Stop/Keep cards silently, dot-vote top bottlenecks, and leave strictly with TWO small concrete changes carrying named owners and Tuesday deadlines. Two solved fixes beat twenty forgotten sticky notes.",
