                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Before commissioning shiny brand-new content, catalog existing pages cleanly inside an inventory spreadsheet recording URL, Topic Pillar, Funnel Stage, 90-day views, and conversion assist. Classify every page cleanly under **Keep**, **Update/Refresh**, **Merge/Redirect**, or **Archive/Prune** (`ROT`: Redundant, Outdated, Trivial).",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "ROT Audit",
                      "text": "Systematically reviewing content inventory to identify Redundant overlaps, Outdated steps/claims, and Trivial zero-value stubs needing consolidation or pruning.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Two half-baked posts (`\"Hiring Tips 2022\"` + `\"First Interview Questions\"`) with low traffic merge into one sharp `\"Complete First-Time Hiring Playbook\"`, 301-redirecting both old URLs cleanly.",
