                      "text": "Pillar Pages & Cluster Spokes",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Organize knowledge intuitively around a central broad **Pillar Hub** covering an entire core competency overview, linked tightly bi-directionally to 5–8 focused **Cluster Spokes** drilling deep into specific sub-questions (`Setup`, `Pricing Math`, `Common Pitfalls`). Bi-directional linking helps readers explore linearly while proving deep domain coverage.",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Pillar-Cluster Model",
                      "text": "An interconnected content structure anchoring one comprehensive overview hub cleanly to multiple focused sub-topic deep-dives via purposeful mutual internal links.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Pillar: Complete Guide to Remote Onboarding -> Clusters: 1. Day-1 IT Security Checklist, 2. Async Buddy Pairing Templates, 3. 30-60-90 Day Goals, 4. Cross-Time-Zone Sync Policy.",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Sample Hub Architecture"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Pick 3 core problem domains closely aligned to your product/mission.",
                        "Map 1 cornerstone Pillar + 5–8 narrow sub-questions per domain.",
                        "Link Pillar down to every Spoke, and link Spokes back cleanly upward to the Pillar + adjacent Spokes."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Topical Authority Via Hub-and-Spoke Clusters"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Six brilliant technical posts sat unreachable three clicks deep with zero links connecting them to flagship guides.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Orphaned Deep Tutorials",
                      "takeaway": "Interlinking cleanly into one organized cluster multiplied multi-page reader sessions cleanly."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Mapping the whole 6-piece family upfront eliminates accidental topic overlap across future months.",
