                  "id": "78ce5d4c-f014-b734-897f-44a378b35813",
                  "title": "Balancing Bottom-of-Funnel Reality With Top-of-Funnel Reach",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Full-Funnel Portfolio Balance",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Healthy content strategies balance all three stages honestly: Top-of-Funnel (`Educational Workflows` solving everyday friction cleanly), Middle-of-Funnel (`Honest Comparisons, ROI Guides, Checklists` helping buyers choose approaches fairly), and Bottom/Post-Sale (`Implementation Case Studies & Activation Guides` turning trials into thriving customers). Start bottom-up if budgets stay tiny!",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Bottom-Up Strategy",
                      "text": "Publishing high-intent implementation, comparison, and customer-proof assets first so existing prospects convert better before chasing high-volume cold traffic.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Instead of ten generic `\"What Is Marketing?\"` intros, launch first with `\"Agency Client Reporting Template\"`, `\"Tool A vs. Manual Spreadsheets Fair Comparison\"`, and 2 honest turnaround breakdowns.",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Small-Team Allocation"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Audit current funnel balance—spot if 90% sits strictly at Top-of-Funnel fluff.",
                        "Interview recent happy buyers asking \"What pushed you across from hesitant to ready?\"—build middle-funnel answers around those exact fears.",
                        "Treat onboarding/help documentation cleanly as critical retention content strategy!"
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Balancing Bottom-of-Funnel Reality With Top-of-Funnel Reach"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "A startup published 40 glossary basics definitions while buyers hunting `\"Does Tool X integrate with Shopify?\"` bounced from empty search results.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "All-Top Funnel Imbalance",
                      "takeaway": "Shipping 8 crisp integration & workflow playbooks unlocked immediate demo conversions."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "High-intent buyer questions convert smoothly at one-tenth the raw traffic needed at top of funnel.",
                      "type": "callout",
                      "title": "Start From Sales & Onboarding Questions",
                      "variant": "tip"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "knowledge_check",
                      "prompt": "If a young team has time for only four strategic pieces this quarter, where should focus land first?",
                      "options": [
                        "Encyclopedia definitions of industry terms",
                        "High-intent decision comparisons, real workflow templates, and honest implementation proof closest to buyer friction",
                        "Company holiday recaps"
                      ],
                      "explanation": "Bottom-up utility serves active decision-makers cleanly before broad cold scaling begins.",
                      "correctIndex": 1
                    }
