                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Designing Fast Time-to-First-Value (`TTFV`)",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Buying energy peaks right at signature—and cools fast if Week 1 feels confusing or slow! Engineer onboarding strictly to get new clients across their **first tangible milestone win inside 48–72 hours (`Time-to-First-Value`)**: clean pre-filled starter templates, guided 15-minute setup checklists (`max 3–4 items!`), and warm quick celebration notes acknowledging Milestone #1 completed.",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Time-to-First-Value (TTFV)",
                      "text": "The elapsed duration from initial purchase or signup until a new customer experiences their first indisputable, meaningful real outcome—the strongest predictor of long-term retention.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Instead of sending empty blank workspaces + 14 training videos Day 1, pre-load 2 sample workflows matching their exact industry so they edit one real template and send live value inside 20 minutes!",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Accelerating TTFV"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Identify the SINGLE clearest first win proving early ROI within Week 1.",
                        "Cut bloated 18-step kickoff homework down to 3 crisp micro-wins.",
                        "Alert onboarding coordinators automatically whenever a Day-7 account still hasn’t cleared Milestone #1!"
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Churn Starts Silently in Week 1, Not Month 11"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "65% of self-serve subscribers never returned after Day 2 purely because facing empty blank configuration screens felt exhausting after a busy workday.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Blank-Canvas Abandonment",
                      "takeaway": "Shipping clean starter templates lifted Day-30 active retention cleanly over +40%!"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Sending a genuine brief note (`\"Saw your very first workflow shipped live—awesome milestone!\"`) anchors immediate momentum and human warmth!",
