                  "title": "Anatomy of a Compelling Case Study",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Problem, Your Role, Process & Verified Result",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Structure every featured portfolio piece around four fast-scannable blocks: 1) **Problem & Goal** (who needed what and why it mattered), 2) **Your Specific Contribution** (crucial on team projects!), 3) **Process & Trade-Offs** (sketches, drafts, or bug fixes showing how you think), and 4) **Outcome & Reflection** (live link, screenshot, rubric outcome, and what you’d refine next).",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Portfolio Case Study",
                      "text": "A concise structured narrative framing a real artifact with its problem context, your specific process decisions, and verified results.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Writers, marketers, and coordinators showcase campaign calendars, edited before/after memos, audit checklists, and live articles cleanly alongside screenshots.",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Non-Code Portfolios Too"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Curate your best 2–4 complete case studies—hide half-baked tutorials.",
                        "State exact tools/skills used and your individual role clearly.",
                        "Lead each project with a clean preview visual plus direct 1-click artifact link."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Anatomy of a Compelling Case Study"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Adding 3 short paragraphs explaining *why* she restructured a client’s checkout flow turned a static screenshot into a job offer.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Context Unlocked Offer",
                      "takeaway": "Hiring leads hire your judgment as much as final polish."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Including rough wireframes, edited copy markups, or test logs proves authenticity and rigor immediately.",
                      "type": "callout",
                      "title": "Show Before & After",
                      "variant": "tip"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "knowledge_check",
                      "prompt": "What turns a bare screenshot or GitHub link into a high-converting portfolio piece?",
                      "options": [
                        "Background music",
                        "Explaining the problem, your specific role, key decisions made, and measurable/verified outcome",
                        "Listing 30 tutorials"
