                    {
                      "text": "Repeatable Zero-Slip Sign-Off Routines",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Great copyeditors and proofreaders maintain lightweight custom sign-off checklists tailored to common errors: verify headline/deck consistency, verify image/caption alignment, check navigation anchors/links, audit math/date consistency, verify formatting cleanliness on mobile/desktop previews, and capture new house style entries cleanly before archiving.",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Pre-Publish Editorial Gate",
                      "text": "A concise final 8-item verification ritual run strictly after final author query resolution immediately ahead of publishing or printing.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "1. Headlines/subheads typo-checked letter-by-letter. 2. Numbers/dates reconciled. 3. Step/Table sequences verified. 4. Links clicked incognito. 5. Captions/alts checked. 6. Metadata/filename cleaned. 7. Confusables scanned. 8. Clean preview inspected visually.",
