                      "title": "Applying Closing the Understanding Loop"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Two analysts left a kickoff thinking the other was cleaning historical CSV rows, losing three days before review.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "The Unconfirmed Handover",
                      "takeaway": "A two-line Slack recap naming each owner prevents double work and dropped tasks."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Volunteer a 30-second verbal or written recap at the end of every alignment conversation.",
