                      "title": "Make Lead Magnets Fast to Use",
                      "variant": "tip"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "knowledge_check",
                      "prompt": "Why outperform focused 2-page checklists bloated 80-page eBooks or generic contests for lead quality?",
