                        "List two alternative neutral factual explanations.",
                        "Take one calm verification step instead of spiraling."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Breaking Cognitive Distortions Fast"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Reframing a blunt email from \"I am incompetent\" to \"They need tighter timeline visibility before board week\" freed an analyst to deliver an impressive fix same day.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Surviving a Tough Client Review",
                      "takeaway": "Balanced thinking preserves focus energy cleanly."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "If a fear relies purely on guessed motives, verify gently instead of spiraling silently.",
                      "type": "callout",
                      "title": "Ask \"What Facts Support This Story?\"",
                      "variant": "tip"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "knowledge_check",
                      "prompt": "What error occurs when you assume silence from a busy leader equals disapproval?",
