                    {
                      "text": "When launch pipelines fail or clients escalate, teams immediately mirror leaders' faces and Slack speed. Staying steady doesn't mean faking robotic cheer; it means naming reality plainly (\"This setback is serious, and here is our focused triage sequence\") so anxiety turns toward coordinated execution.",
                      "type": "paragraph"
