                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "True empathy validates constraints (\"Carrying two sick kids while hitting Thursday close is brutal\") and collaborates fairly (\"Let's see which piece moves cleanly to next sprint\") without silently taking over everyone's work out of guilt. Over-functioning exhausts helpers and stalls peer growth.",
