                    },
                    {
                      "body": "\"Sounds overwhelming juggling three audits—I can take QA on report 1 today if you brief me 5 mins; let's flag report 3 timeline with Sam.\"",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Compassionate Boundary Help"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
