                    {
                      "text": "When you snap unfairly or jump to defensive assumptions, repair within hours—not weeks later hoping everyone forgot. Name what happened directly (\"I was abrupt cutting you off in stand-up—your timeline point deserved full hearing; I'm sorry\") without hedging excuses (\"sorry IF you felt hurt\"). Clean repairs actually deepen long-term trust.",
