                        "Split tie-breaking decision authority cleanly by functional domain rather than paralyzing every choice 50/50.",
                        "Keep contractor deliverables tied cleanly to milestone outputs rather than fuzzy endless retainers early."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Healthy Co-Founder & Contractor Clarity"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Two college friends split a new agency 50/50 verbally Day 1; Partner B quit three months later for corporate employment yet demanded 50% profit payouts forever.",
