                      "text": "Accelerating Inflows, Aligning Outflows",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Healthy finance balances three working-capital clocks cleanly: **Days Sales Outstanding (`Collect client invoices faster`)**, **Days Inventory Held (`Keep lean fast-turning stock rather than dusty warehouses`)**, and **Days Payables (`Take full polite agreed vendor credit terms—never prepay bills needlessly early when terms stay zero-interest!`)**. Shrinking that gap frees effortless zero-debt internal cash!",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Cash Conversion Cycle",
                      "text": "How many calendar days elapse between paying cash outward to produce/deliver inventory or labor and collecting final cleared customer payment back into checking.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Consulting studio shifts cleanly from `\"Invoice 100% Net-30 at finish\"` (45-day cash lag!) -> `\"50% Kickoff Deposit + 50% Upon Staging Link\"` -> Funding contractor costs cleanly upfront from buyer deposits!",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Flipping Working Capital Positive"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Invoice immediately right upon delivery milestones—never batch invoices leisurely once monthly!",
                        "Offer gentle convenience links (`ACH / Instant card / Auto-pay`)—friction delays human check writing by weeks!",
                        "Negotiate clean vendor Net-30 terms once payment reliability establishes trust."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying The Cash Conversion Cycle & Working Capital Levers"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "A busy contractor waited till the 28th of every month to mail manual PDF invoices holding Net-30 terms—effectively extending free 60-day loans on every single project!",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Slow Billing Self-Sabotage",
                      "takeaway": "Automating immediate milestone invoicing unlocked $22,000 permanent working cash cleanly in one quarter!"
                    },
