                      "text": "Every resilient business maintains a crisp **13-Week Rolling Cash Forecast**: columns representing exact Fridays (`Week 1..13`) showing Literal Opening Cash + Expected Cleared Collections minus Literal Weekly Payouts (`Payroll, Rent, Vendor Bills, Taxes`) = Ending Cash. Scanning thirteen weeks ahead weekly spots temporary dip troughs two months early while solutions stay effortless and calm!",
