                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Frame every major new fixed commitment cleanly through **Payback & Stress Math**: Compute true **Fully Loaded Cost (`Salary x 1.2–1.3` covering payroll taxes, benefits, tools, onboarding ramp!)**, estimate realistically how many slow weeks ramp-up takes ahead of full output (`often 60–90 days!`), and verify your current base cash + margin still stays green even if projected revenue lift takes twice as long!",
