                      "text": "True total monthly company outlay per full-time hire—adding payroll taxes, insurance, software licenses, equipment, and benefits (`typically 1.2x–1.35x` above base salary).",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Base role salary: $4,000/mo -> Fully Loaded cost: ~$5,000/mo. At 50% Gross Margin, company must sustain `+$10,000/mo` new revenue (or reclaim equivalent senior founder billable hours) strictly to break even on that hire—plus verify cash buffer covers 3 slow ramp months cleanly!",
