                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Weekly Done / Waiting / Next Check-Ins",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Beat clients to the punch every Friday afternoon with a 5-line update: 1) **Completed this week** (with preview link/visual), 2) **Action needed from you** (with bold due date to stay on schedule), 3) **Focus next week**. Proactive structure turns nervous buyers into relaxed partners.",
