                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Digging Your Well Before You’re Thirsty",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Build relationships through shared craft curiosity and small thoughtful gestures: share helpful articles, introduce two complementary peers (\"Maya builds sharp accessible sites; Sam writes great B2B copy—thought you two might enjoy knowing each other\"), attend small niche critiques, and check in thoughtfully every few months with zero immediate ask.",
