                      "body": "\"Hey Lee—saw this breakdown on Meta CAPI updates and remembered your Q3 retail project! Hope studio launches are going smoothly.\"",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Thoughtful Keep-Warm Note"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Ask permission from both sides before making intros.",
                        "Build genuine friendships with horizontal peers—they become future hiring leads and co-founders!",
                        "Keep a simple personal contact log reminding you to check in quarterly."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Generosity-First Networking Over Transactional Pitching"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Helping a fellow copywriter fix a CSS snag led her to refer two £1,800 client landing-page projects over the next 6 months.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Peer Referral Chain",
                      "takeaway": "Peer goodwill compounds quietly over years."
