                    {
                      "text": "Once a core deliverable succeeds repeatedly (monthly SEO audits, UI cleanups, weekly analytics reports), offer past satisfied clients clean fixed-scope **retainers** or **productized audits** (\"Monthly 4-Hour Optimization & Reporting Pack\"). Keep light outreach flowing even during busy months so your pipeline never hits zero simultaneously.",
