                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Productize your highest-value repeatable diagnostic.",
                        "Keep 1–2 hours weekly reserved for pipeline care even when busy.",
                        "Raise rates gradually on *new* quotes once bookings exceed ~75% capacity."
