                      "title": "Applying Retainers, Productized Services & Healthy Pipelines"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Signing three modest £450/month optimization retainers covered fixed rent/bills by the 1st of every month, turning project work into pure upside.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Predictable Baseline Achieved",
                      "takeaway": "Modest recurring retainers eliminate feast-or-famine panic."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Leaving 15% weekly capacity prevents sloppy rushed deliveries that hurt your reputation.",
