                      "explanation": "An ID selector (#header-cta = 1-0-0) outweighs any number of class (0-2-0) or element (0-0-3) selectors.",
                      "correctIndex": 1
                    }
                  ],
                  "videos": [],
                  "summary": "Flat class architecture paired with CSS custom properties makes themes consistent and refactoring painless.",
