                  "est_minutes": 28,
                  "is_required": true,
                  "introduction": "Subtle wording flips survey responses 30+ percentage points (`\"Don’t you agree slow invoicing hurts small shops?\"` guarantees artificial \"Yes\" scores!).",
                  "further_reading": [
