                      "title": "True Competition Discovery"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Ask `\"What else were you using/doing right before trying this?\"` to expose real non-obvious rivals.",
                        "Explore three dimensions: Functional task (`save 2 hrs`), Emotional feeling (`feel confident not anxious ahead of client calls`), and Social signaling (`look organized to leadership`).",
                        "Design messaging speaking cleanly to BOTH practical metrics AND calm emotional relief!"
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Customers \"Hire\" Products to Get a Job Done"
