                },
                {
                  "id": "937acf74-a9d1-d470-d738-2d3b698dab65",
                  "title": "Honest Win/Loss Interviews That Reveal Truth",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Neutral Third-Party Win/Loss Insights",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Every lost deal—and every surprisingly fast closed win!—holds invaluable research proof. Wait 7–14 days gently post-decision, skip defensive sales arguing completely (\"We aren’t calling to re-pitch you—strictly 10 minutes learning honestly where our brief fell short so we serve buyers better\"), and probe what tipped their final confidence cleanly toward the chosen path (or why they stayed put with Excel).",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Win/Loss Research",
                      "text": "Brief non-sales retrospective interviews with both recently won buyers AND lost/churned prospects probing honest perception gaps, hidden switching barriers, and actual competitor selection triggers.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "CRM said `\"Too expensive.\"` Honest 10-min Win/Loss follow-up revealed: `\"Price wasn’t the issue—your team skipped answering how our payroll tax filings sync, while Competitor B showed a live 2-minute sample report!\"`",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Revealing Lost-Deal Insight"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
