                      "text": "Determine required sample size and minimum runtime (always at least 1–2 full 7-day business cycles covering weekday + weekend buyer rhythms) BEFORE launching. Never pause a test early just because day-3 numbers look exciting, verify clean 50/50 Sample Ratio parity (SRM check), and demand ~95% confidence alongside a meaningful practical effect size.",
