                      "text": "Repeatedly checking interim A/B results daily and stopping the moment p < 0.05 flashes—massively inflating false-positive winner rates.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Even if sample target clears by Day 5, let the experiment complete full 7 or 14 days so Tuesday corporate buyers and Sunday casual shoppers weigh evenly.",
