                      "title": "Turning Flat Growth Around Via Narrowing",
                      "takeaway": "Narrow focus sharpens every word and pound spent."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "A strategy with zero rejected tactics is merely a wish list.",
                      "type": "callout",
                      "title": "Strategy = Choosing What Not to Do",
