                        "Assert visible DOM outcomes and URL routes rather than private internal variables.",
                        "Verify cleanup on signout and unauthorized route guards."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying End-to-End Critical Journeys & DOM Harness Testing"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Testing Login, Signup, and Reset password toggles in the DOM harness caught a missing event bind on the Reset screen immediately.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Broken Password Toggle Caught",
                      "takeaway": "Automated UI binding tests catch wiring mistakes cleanly."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Put 70% coverage in fast unit/engine tests, 20% in DB/repo integration tests, and 10% in E2E flows.",
