                    "Remember walking away beats a bad contract"
                  ],
                  "objectives": [
                    "Analyze calculating objective walk-away leverage",
                    "Apply batna, walk-away & zopa in realistic scenarios"
                  ],
                  "est_minutes": 28,
                  "is_required": true,
                  "introduction": "Fear during negotiation comes from not knowing your real alternative if talks fail.",
                  "further_reading": [
