                    "Never lower your offer before receiving a counter-offer",
                    "Stay comfortable with 4-second pauses"
                  ],
                  "objectives": [
                    "Analyze credible reference anchoring",
                    "Apply evidence-backed anchoring in realistic scenarios"
                  ],
                  "est_minutes": 28,
                  "is_required": true,
                  "introduction": "The first reasonable number framed with solid rationale pulls final settlement strongly toward itself.",
                  "further_reading": [
                    {
                      "url": "https://hbr.org/",
