                    {
                      "text": "For Meta video ads, track `Thumbstop / Hook Rate = 3-Second Video Plays / Impressions` (aim >= 25–30%), `Hold Rate = ThruPlays (15s) / 3-Second Plays`, and `Outbound CTR` (`>= 1%` target benchmark for cold traffic). High Hook + low Hold means your opener intrigued viewers but the middle dragged; strong CTR + poor site CVR points straight to landing-page speed or offer friction.",
