                      "text": "Editing Story Momentum Smoothly",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Trim dead air, false starts, and \"so yeah um\" tails aggressively (\"cut late into clips, exit early\"). Bridge visual jump cuts smoothly using **B-Roll** (cutaways showing hands typing, products working, or diagrams), and deploy **J-Cuts** (next speaker/scene audio arrives 0.5s *before* video switches) and **L-Cuts** (speaker’s voice continues briefly *over* next visual cutaway) for cinema smoothness.",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
