                      "term": "J-Cut & L-Cut",
                      "text": "Split-edit audio/video overlaps where sound leads into the next shot (J-cut) or carries smoothly over an incoming visual cutaway (L-cut), hiding jarring abrupt edits.",
                      "type": "definition"
