                  "title": "Opportunity Solution Trees (Connecting Strategy Cleanly)",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Teresa Torres’ Opportunity Tree Discipline",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Map discovery cleanly using **Opportunity Solution Trees**: anchor strictly ONE measurable **Desired Outcome** at the root (`\"Cut Week-1 Setup Drop-off 30%\"`), branch below strictly into verified **User Opportunities / Pains** uncovered in real interviews (`\"Users feel confused mapping invoice columns\"`), explore **multiple competing Solution ideas** per priority branch, and run tiny fast **Assumption Tests** before committing heavy full engineering builds!",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Opportunity Solution Tree",
                      "text": "A visual mapping framework connecting one targeted product outcome directly through discovered user pain branches (`Opportunities`) down to multiple lightweight solution options and cheap validation tests.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Opportunity: Users worry importing messy CSV will wreck live data. Solution A: Full Undo History (6 wks). Solution B: Dry-Run Preview Screen (3 days). Solution C: Read-Only Sandbox Mode (2 wks) -> Test clean Dry-Run Preview first rapidly!",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Exploring 3 Solutions Instead of Fixing #1"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Always force at least **2–3 distinct alternative solutions** per high-priority user pain—never sprint blindly on the very first obvious build idea!",
                        "Attach concrete user interview counts (`seen in 7/10 user sessions`) onto branches to weigh priority fairly.",
                        "Kill weak assumptions swiftly in days via clickable Figma prototypes ahead of writing backend databases!"
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Opportunity Solution Trees (Connecting Strategy Cleanly)"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Engineers spent two months coding an elaborate automated Undo Rollback engine before testing a 3-day simple `\"Preview Changes Before Saving\"` confirmation card that solved user fear 100% cleanly!",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "6-Week Overbuilt Fix",
                      "takeaway": "Comparing alternative paths early saves literally entire quarters of engineering time cleanly!"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Forcing three genuinely distinct solution sketches per problem exposes simpler, 10x cheaper ways to solve identical pain cleanly!",
                      "type": "callout",
                      "title": "Never Fall in Love With Idea #1",
                      "variant": "tip"
                    },
