                  ],
                  "takeaways": [
                    "Structure roadmaps around Problems/Outcomes over rigid date promises",
                    "Communicate shifting priorities transparently alongside clear trade-offs",
                    "Lock firm external launch dates strictly late once build risks clear"
                  ],
                  "objectives": [
                    "Explain now-next-later roadmaps over brittle gantt lies",
                    "Apply communicating roadmap changes & now-next-later clarity practically"
