                    "Respect colleagues' rest hours with scheduled sends"
                  ],
                  "objectives": [
                    "Explain predictable focus & out-of-office hygiene",
                    "Apply reliable availability & working boundaries in everyday scenarios"
                  ],
                  "est_minutes": 28,
                  "is_required": true,
                  "introduction": "Burnout often stems from unclear working expectations rather than actual workload.",
                  "further_reading": [
