                    {
                      "body": "Decision Needed: Approve migration to shared ticketing by Nov 12. Impact: Cuts duplicate support triage 35% at zero extra license cost.",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Executive Memo Header"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Identify who holds approval or implementation ownership.",
                        "Place conclusion, cost, and deadline inside the top 8 lines.",
                        "Move detailed vendor tables into labeled appendices or lower sections."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Anatomy of High-Trust Workplace Writing"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "A 5-page proposal hid the requested $4,200 fee on page 4, delaying approval by two billing cycles.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Buried Budget Approval",
                      "takeaway": "Adding an upfront 4-line summary block secured sign-off in 48 hours."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Assume readers only spend 30 seconds on pass one—make sure those 30 seconds convey the decision accurately.",
