                },
                {
                  "id": "4974ba6c-64b1-4e49-d220-5b31765c81d5",
                  "title": "Honest Weekly Stakeholder Briefs (`RAG` Reporting)",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Red-Yellow-Green Transparency & Escalation Etiquette",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Weekly **RAG (`Red / Amber-Yellow / Green`)** status briefs respect executive time with five crystal lines: (1) **Overall Health Pill + 1-Line Why**, (2) **Shipped This Week**, (3) **Key Focus Next Week**, (4) **Top Risk/Blocker**, and (5) **Explicit Action Needed From Sponsor (`by Wednesday 5pm`)**. Escalate **Amber/Yellow** calmly WITH proposed recovery options (`\"Amber: vendor testing slipped 3d -> testing backup CSV path Friday; zero launch impact yet\"`).",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Watermelon Status Anti-Pattern",
                      "text": "Projects consistently marked reassuring \"Green\" on outside leadership slides right up until sudden failure exposes ugly internal \"Red\" delays—destroying trust overnight.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "\"Status: AMBER — Database schema check surfaced unexpected duplicate accounts taking ~3 extra cleanup days. Plan: pausing non-critical icon polish cleanly keeps Oct 30 launch intact. Decision needed: approve icon deferment by Thu noon?\"",
                      "type": "example",
