                    {
                      "text": "Combine greeting + full question + context links + proposed option inside ONE message (\"Hi Sam! Reviewing the Friday deploy—should we pause onboarding emails while fixing the filter? Link here; leaning Yes unless I hear objections by 3pm UTC\"). Teammates reply decisively in one pass without scheduling another call.",
