                      "text": "Create a repeatable 5-minute end-of-day shutdown ritual: update tomorrow’s #1 starter note, close work browser profile/tabs, update chat status offline, and physically step away (walk, music, tidy desk). True sustainable output comes from crisp focus followed by genuine guilt-free rest.",
