                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Sort major themes cleanly from highest risk/impact to minor.",
                        "Distinguish recurring systemic patterns from isolated one-off accidents.",
                        "Highlight quick low-effort wins separately from deeper multi-quarter rebuilds."
