                    "Include baseline status-quo honestly",
                    "Disclose downside caveats on the winning choice"
                  ],
                  "objectives": [
                    "Explain weighted criteria & decision transparency",
                    "Apply feasibility & recommendation reports cleanly"
                  ],
                  "est_minutes": 28,
                  "is_required": true,
                  "introduction": "When leadership asks \"Should we build in-house, buy SaaS, or outsource?\", reports must weigh comparable evidence fairly.",
                  "further_reading": [
