                      "text": "Symptom vs. Problem vs. Guessed Fix",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Weak framing bakes one assumed tool inside the problem diagnosis. Crisp problem statements quantify observable current reality, desired target, who hurts, and when friction hits—leaving creative room to find simpler, faster systemic remedies.",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Clean Problem Statement",
                      "text": "Concise statement detailing affected persona, observable baseline vs. target gap, frequency, and cost—with zero prescribed tool inside.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Swap \"We need an AI chatbot\" for \"42% of first-time applicants stall over 15 minutes at tax ID upload, triggering 110 weekly tickets.\"",
