                      "title": "Rewriting Onboarding Complaint"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Spot premature tools hidden inside problem labels.",
                        "Measure exact magnitude and who experiences it.",
                        "Identify where in the journey drop-off actually occurs."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Never Smuggle Solutions Into Problems"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Inspecting the raw funnel proved simplifying two confusing tax labels fixed drop-off in two days—obsoleting an expensive AI build.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Saved Six Months of Engineering",
                      "takeaway": "Honest framing uncovers dramatically cheaper solutions."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Your closing metric check guarantees clarity upfront.",
