                    {
                      "text": "Instead of wandering blindly through 50 dashboards during a sudden metric drop, state three concrete mutually exclusive hypotheses (\"1. Tracking pixel broke Tuesday; 2. Safari mobile bug deployed; 3. Paid social traffic mix shifted\") and design the quickest 10-minute falsification check for each. Disproving two leaves focus laser-sharp cleanly.",
