                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Write top 3 distinct plausible causes upfront.",
                        "Check the fastest easiest-to-rule-out bucket first.",
                        "Pivot swiftly cleanly whenever data falsifies a favorite guess."
