                    {
                      "text": "Real leadership happens amid incomplete puzzles. When 70% evidence favors a low-risk reversible step and waiting costs daily damage, ship the reversible step transparently paired with short monitoring triggers rather than stalling indefinitely over minor missing footnotes.",
