                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Great discovery flows gently like an organic coffee chat moving from broad workflow clarity (**How does X happen today?**) into concrete pain (**Where does it stall or break down?**) and gently uncovering **Quantified Impact** (**\"When that invoicing error repeats twice monthly, roughly how many staff hours disappear untangling it—and what happens to Q4 close?\"**). Pause two seconds after answers—great gems emerge cleanly right inside the silence after their first sentence!",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Quantified Impact Prompt",
                      "text": "Gentle diagnostic questioning guiding prospects smoothly to connect minor annoying surface bugs directly to larger wasted team hours, lost revenue, churn, or compliance risks.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Surface: \"Yeah reporting takes a while.\" Impact Prompt: \"Roughly how many hours does Maya spend reconciling spreadsheets monthly—and what high-priority client strategy does that delay?\"",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Surface Pain -> True Urgency"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Ask `\"Walk me through...\"`, `\"How does that impact...\"`, and `\"What have you tried fixing so far?\"` rather than leading yes/no traps.",
                        "Mirror last 2–3 critical key words neutrally (`\"Lost client trust...?\"`) encouraging deeper unforced candor.",
                        "Capture verbatim emotional buyer quotes into CRM notes cleanly to reuse inside proposals!"
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying High-Value Discovery Questions & Active Listening"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Rep confirmed buyer wanted \"faster PDF exports\" and stopped digging—losing quietly to \"Stay with Excel\" because $50/mo felt unnecessary merely for saving 5 minor clicks.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Shallow Feature Win Loss",
                      "takeaway": "Uncovering the $2,400/mo late billing penalty unlocked unmistakable ROI immediately!"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Counting quietly \"1... 2...\" after prospects finish speaking routinely invites them to add the real unfiltered truth sitting underneath polite opening remarks!",
                      "type": "callout",
                      "title": "Wait 2 Full Beats After Answers",
                      "variant": "tip"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "knowledge_check",
                      "prompt": "What separates deep Consultative Impact Discovery from flat checklist interrogation?",
                      "options": [
