                      "text": "Whether mapping SEO topic hubs or Google Ads ad groups, isolate commercial modifiers (\"agency\", \"cost\", \"near me\", \"comparison\") and proactively exclude irrelevant modifiers (\"salary\", \"course\", \"free template\", \"login\") using negative keyword lists before spending a single pound.",
