                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Natural Semantic Coverage",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Search algorithms understand natural language synonyms, related entities, and sub-questions deeply now. Instead of shoehorning awkward exact strings every hundred words, write cleanly for human fluency while naturally covering the complete cluster of real follow-up concepts a genuinely knowledgeable mentor covers (`reconciliation`, `quarterly tax`, `invoice aging`, `audit trails`).",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Semantic Topical Depth",
                      "text": "Thoroughly answering the natural related concepts, workflows, edge cases, and follow-up questions surrounding a topic rather than repeating one rigid keyword string robotically.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Stuffed: \"Our SEO writing checklist helps with SEO writing because SEO writing tips improve SEO writing.\" Natural: \"This search optimization workflow checks search intent, semantic subheadings, and metadata clarity.\"",
