                      "title": "Cutesy Cryptic Subheads",
                      "takeaway": "Renumbering clear descriptive headings (`\"Visa Documents Needed at Border\"`) tripled organic referrals cleanly."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Use `\"How to Calculate...\"`, `\"When to Avoid...\"`, and `\"Common Mistakes With...\"` naturally wherever searchers need direct fast scans.",
