                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Visual Diagrams & Comparison Grids",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Whenever comparing options, processes, or timelines, swap monotonous bullets for 3-column comparison cards, clean horizontal 4-step process chevrons, or bold big-number KPI callouts (\"42% -> 18% drop-off\"). Visual geometry embeds structural relationships directly so listeners grasp comparisons effortlessly.",
