                    {
                      "term": "System-Dependent vs. Hero-Dependent",
                      "text": "Operations running reliably via simple shared checklists, visual standards, and clean handoffs (`System-Dependent`) rather than constant owner rescue interventions (`Hero-Dependent`).",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Instead of yelling Friday morning why espresso wands sat dirty, mount one laminated 8-box visual Closing Checklist right beside the register signed nightly in 4 minutes cleanly!",
