                    {
                      "text": "Install a brisk standing **10-Minute Daily or Shift Kickoff Huddle**: `1. Yesterday’s Quick Win / Quality Check, 2. Today’s Special Priorities & VIP/Tight Orders, 3. Resource Gaps or Broken Gear`. Pair live huddles cleanly with one shared digital/clipboard **Shift Handoff Log** so afternoon teams never blindside morning teams—or customers!",
