                      "term": "Standing Shift Huddle",
                      "text": "A focused 8–10 minute pre-shift team alignment synchronizing today’s load, custom exceptions, and equipment bottlenecks strictly before doors open or tickets queue.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "`\"Morning Note: Order #408 requested nut-free wrap verified; Printer B low toner (backup cartridge shelf 2); Maria covering early close.\"`",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Clean Handoff Log Line"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
