                {
                  "id": "62a9ec57-df01-77a9-2395-fc686f06b1aa",
                  "title": "Fair Scheduling, Coaching & Retaining Star Staff",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Predictable Cadences & Clear Coaching",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Retention in small shops, clinics, and studios hinges largely on daily respect: publish fair stable shifts cleanly **2+ weeks ahead**, build clear **4-Step Coaching (`Tell -> Show -> Do Together -> Check Independently`)** instead of tossing newcomers into busy shifts blindly, and separate `\"Unclear Expectations / Missing Tool\"` issues sharply from rare attitude problems during calm private 1:1 conversations.",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Four-Step Hands-On Training",
                      "text": "Classic operational teaching loop: Explain why & standards (`Tell`), demonstrate calmly once (`Show`), coach gently while trainee leads (`Do Together`), and verify solo confidence before stepping back (`Check`).",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Instead of sighing passive-aggressively about messy stock rooms all week, hold a 5-minute calm private huddle: show exact photo standard, verify shelf space works easily, and agree daily 4:45 PM reset cue!",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Respectful Boundary Feedback"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Lock team work schedules reliably early—chronic last-minute shifts wreck personal trust instantly!",
                        "Run light supportive 15-minute bi-weekly 1:1 check-ins (`\"What felt smoother this week? What tool/process drove you nuts?\"`).",
                        "Praise reliable everyday craftsmanship specifically in real time (`\"Thank you for catching that fragile pack carefully on order #310\"`)."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Fair Scheduling, Coaching & Retaining Star Staff"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Two bright hires quit in three weeks after receiving zero structured onboarding and getting publicly snapped at for undocumented packing habits.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Sink-or-Swim Turnover",
                      "takeaway": "Adopting calm 4-step training + predictable 2-week shift calendars raised average staff tenure cleanly past 3+ years!"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Address errors quietly one-on-one with curiosity; share customer wins and appreciation warmly in front of peers!",
                      "type": "callout",
                      "title": "Never Critique Publicly; Praise Publicly",
                      "variant": "tip"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "knowledge_check",
                      "prompt": "In the 4-Step Operational Training loop (`Tell -> Show -> Do Together -> Check`), which missing middle step causes most early rookie errors?",
                      "options": [
                        "Posting rules on walls",
                        "Coaching calmly alongside the newcomer during live practice (`Do Together`) before stepping away completely",
                        "Printing thicker binders"
