                {
                  "id": "eb8013d2-58fb-218d-a0c7-6284831dd9f1",
                  "title": "The Single Core Loop & Ruthless Scope Cuts",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Delivering One Unforgettable Aha Moment",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Every sticky product centers around one crisp **Core Value Loop** (`Upload raw file -> Get instant clean risk report -> Share link`). Ship ONLY the single straight path from arrival to that \"Aha!\" moment—cut user settings pages, custom profiles, complex notification centers, and admin analytics cleanly until users return naturally for the core loop.",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Core Value Loop (\"Aha\" Path)",
                      "text": "The absolute shortest user workflow connecting initial problem frustration directly to experiencing your product’s signature relief for the very first time.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Cut for Launch 1: Custom avatars, CSV bulk importer, PDF branding colors, referral badges. Kept ONLY: Paste 1 messy URL -> Generate clean 60-second accessibility scorecard!",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Ruthless v1 Scope Trim"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Trace the literal 3–4 clicks leading straight to core relief; cut every side menu item cleanly.",
                        "Watch 5 real strangers click through silently—never guide their mouse (\"Wait, look up left!\")!",
                        "Fix every friction spot blocking that first 3-minute \"Aha!\" before building shiny extras."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying The Single Core Loop & Ruthless Scope Cuts"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "A productivity startup shipped 14 half-baked tabs (Notes, Chat, Timers, Invoices, Wikis); newcomers felt overwhelmed inside 60 seconds and churned.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Bloated Swiss-Army App",
                      "takeaway": "Stripping strictly down to crystal-clear 2-click Daily Standup Notes doubled Day-7 retention immediately."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Watch 5 real prospects try your MVP silently without coaching them aloud—seeing where eyes freeze exposes hidden friction instantly!",
                      "type": "callout",
                      "title": "Silent User Observation Rules",
                      "variant": "tip"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "knowledge_check",
                      "prompt": "Why remove side features like custom themes, notifications, and settings from an initial startup MVP?",
                      "options": [
                        "Theme CSS slows databases",
                        "Concentrating engineering purely onto the core \"Aha!\" journey ships faster and keeps focus crystal-clear for real learning",
                        "Users hate customization"
                      ],
                      "explanation": "Focused core loops prevent noisy bloat from hiding whether your central solution actually works.",
                      "correctIndex": 1
                    }
                  ],
                  "videos": [],
                  "summary": "Protecting one crisp core value loop gets real insight into buyers’ hands weeks earlier.",
