                    {
                      "text": "Short Crisp Monthly Update Discipline",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Whether reporting to tiny angel backers, mentors, or co-founders, send a clean **Monthly 5-Minute Digest**: `1. Headline Highlights, 2. Exact Numbers (Cash, Burn, Active Retained Users, Runway), 3. Biggest Obstacle Right Now, 4. Specific Helpful Ask (\"Need intro to 2 retail ops managers\")`. Honest proactive transparency makes advisors fight actively to unlock doors for you!",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Specific Helpful Ask",
                      "text": "Closing monthly startup updates with narrow tangible requests mentors can literally fulfill in 2 minutes (\"Intro to X or review landing H1\") rather than vague `\"Let us know thoughts!\"`.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "\"Ask #1: Looking for 15-min feedback chats with two clinic billing managers who process 200+ weekly insurance claims—reply if someone comes to mind!\"",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Crisp Monthly Ask Example"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Keep monthly stakeholder notes tightly structured and consistent even during brutal months.",
                        "Put exact cash and runway plainly inside paragraph one—hiding bad news breaks trust permanently!",
                        "Follow up appreciatively closing the loop whenever someone helps out (\"Your intro led straight to a pilot—thank you!\")."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Investor / Stakeholder Updates & Radical Candor"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "A startup skipped four monthly updates while struggling cleanly with churn—showing up abruptly asking for emergency bridge cash within 10 days got 100% cold rejections.",
