                    {
                      "text": "Wait patiently to push scale throttles until **Four Lights Turn Green**: (1) Clear repeating Cohort Retention floor, (2) Repeatable low-friction acquisition pipe working reliably, (3) Verified positive Unit Contribution + realistic CAC payback (`<12 months` lean), and (4) Standardized 10-step customer onboarding not completely reliant on hero founders improvising daily.",
