                {
                  "id": "682d7aeb-6db1-43b4-8f73-ae01a62631b2",
                  "title": "Pre-Mortems & Defeating Blind Optimism",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Gary Klein’s Prospective Hindsight",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Use a **Pre-Mortem**: gather teams cleanly BEFORE committing resources and say strictly: **\"Imagine cleanly we fast-forward 12 months and this plan FAILED miserably! Take 5 silent minutes writing down every exact realistic reason WHY it blew up!\"** Shifting grammatically into `\"It ALREADY failed\"` unlocks astonishing candor safely—letting skeptics surface fatal blind spots without seeming disloyal!",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Pre-Mortem Exercise",
                      "text": "Diagnostic planning technique imagining a major initiative has already catastrophically failed one year ahead, inviting candid individual silent causes before final launch commitments lock.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Before expanding abroad, silent notes revealed: \"Custom localized support staff couldn’t answer billing hours cleanly across time zones + tax registration stalled 4 months!\" -> Fixed BEFORE signing a single overseas lease!",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Pre-Mortem Gold"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Make initial 5-minute failure-brainstorming strictly **SILENT writing** so junior dissenters aren’t silenced by confident seniors!",
                        "Group top recurring threat patterns calmly into proactive **Guardrail Mitigations**.",
                        "Designate an explicit rotating `\"Constructive Challenger\"` role cleanly on major One-Way proposals!"
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Pre-Mortems & Defeating Blind Optimism"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Every executive cheered a flashy physical showroom expansion publicly even while three managers privately doubted foot traffic—failing badly inside 9 months.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Echo-Chamber Expansion Crash",
                      "takeaway": "A simple 20-minute Pre-Mortem turns polite silence into saved capital cleanly!"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Teams thanking quiet critical dissenters before launch dodge expensive public disasters quietly!",
                      "type": "callout",
                      "title": "Protect Polite Skeptics Early",
                      "variant": "tip"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "knowledge_check",
                      "prompt": "Why does the specific framing \"Imagine 12 months later this plan HAS ALREADY FAILED—write why\" unlock far sharper insights than asking \"What risks do you see?\"",
                      "options": [
                        "Takes less paper",
                        "Breaks polite group-think optimism safely by making identifying real structural flaws socially expected and helpful rather than disloyal pessimism",
