                    {
                      "body": "Pre-mortem exercise surfaced that support reps lacked rollback docs during holiday weekend launch—fixed cleanly in 3 hours ahead of go-live.",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Uncovering Training Gaps Early"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Frame failure as vivid certainty during the 5-minute brainstorm.",
                        "Collect causes silently before voting top 3 threats.",
                        "Assign one preventive guardrail owner per critical failure mode."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying The Pre-Mortem Technique"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "A pre-mortem forced testing multi-currency rounding edge cases skipped in normal checklist reviews—preventing costly reconciliation disaster.",
