                      "text": "Start with honest confidence estimates based on current proof, stay genuinely watchful for disconfirming facts, and shift smoothly when reliable new data arrives (\"Earlier pilot data supported Option A; after seeing Q2 retention drops across 600 accounts, moving to B looks markedly stronger\"). Treating beliefs as testable tools rather than ego armor keeps growth sharp forever.",
