                      "text": "Technical documentation must state explicitly what version, credentials, OS privileges, or dependencies must already exist before Step 1 starts. Using consistent exact terms (\"Workspace\" everywhere—never rotating between \"Org\", \"Account\", and \"Space\") stops navigation confusion immediately.",
