                      "text": "Maintainable Visuals & Descriptive Alt Text",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Use screenshots sparingly only where spatial UI complexity genuinely requires orientation—crop tightly around relevant controls, blur fake user emails cleanly, and write informative `alt` text describing the functional state shown. For architectural flows, text-based diagrams (Mermaid/SVG specs) stay cleanly versioned in Git.",
