                      "text": "Cropping UI screenshots closely around the target navigation panel + surrounding landmark so text stays legible and minor sidebar updates rarely break clarity.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Weak alt: \"screenshot1.png\". Strong alt: \"Webhook settings screen showing Create Endpoint button highlighted beside signing secret toggle.\"",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Functional Alt Text"
                    },
