                        "Crop screenshots tightly so button labels stay sharp on narrow screens.",
                        "Always test readability in light/dark viewing conditions and supply clear `alt` text."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Accessible Diagrams & Restraint With Screenshots"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "A tiny footer layout tweak invalidated 42 giant uncropped full-browser PNGs across company help articles.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Stale Full-Screen Captures",
                      "takeaway": "Switching to focused tight crops and crisp imperative UI text cut maintenance hours 80%."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Clear location-first phrasing (\"Under **Profile > Keys**\") survives mild color or CSS tweaks far longer than static screenshots.",
