                {
                  "id": "5e682a05-8e32-c239-52ee-10bd20ea7755",
                  "title": "8px Spacing Rhythm & Gestalt Visual Grouping",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Predictable Spatial Scales & Proximity",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Anchor margins, paddings, and gaps onto a clean 4px/8px progression (`4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64px`). Pair with Gestalt **Proximity**: keep internal card title-to-meta spacing tight (`8px`), card padding medium (`16–20px`), and outer section breaks generous (`40–64px`) so groups visually declare themselves cleanly without heavy noisy borders everywhere.",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Spatial Scale (8px Grid)",
                      "text": "Constraining spacing tokens onto clean multiples of 4/8px so visual alignment stays harmonious across cards, forms, and responsive screens.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "Inside card: Heading -> `6px` -> Meta -> `12px` -> Body. Card padding: `20px`. Gap between cards: `24px`. Never equalize inner and outer gaps!",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Tidy Spacing Rule"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Enforce outer margin >= inner padding >= element spacing.",
                        "Eliminate redundant nested double-borders inside cards.",
                        "Verify clean optical baseline alignment across buttons and inputs."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying 8px Spacing Rhythm & Gestalt Visual Grouping"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Standardizing an unruly SaaS settings page strictly onto `[8, 16, 24, 40px]` tokens eliminated misaligned labels and lifted perceived polish dramatically without changing colors.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Instant Cleanliness Upgrade",
                      "takeaway": "Consistent rhythm whispers high craft immediately."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Replace thick grey divider rules around every list item with generous `16px` breathing space or whisper-light `1px` hairlines.",
                      "type": "callout",
                      "title": "Whitespace Separates Better Than Heavy Lines",
                      "variant": "tip"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "knowledge_check",
                      "prompt": "How does violating the Proximity spacing rule (`outer gap < inner spacing`) confuse interface users?",
                      "options": [
                        "Icons disappear completely",
                        "Visually disconnected labels drift toward neighboring cards, making users misread which caption belongs to which control",
                        "Fonts shrink automatically"
                      ],
                      "explanation": "Tighter inner spacing than outer separation visually locks labels cleanly to their parent controls.",
                      "correctIndex": 1
                    }
                  ],
                  "videos": [],
                  "summary": "Disciplined spatial tokens make complex layouts look calm and effortless automatically.",
                  "position": 1,
                  "resources": [
