                      "text": "Giving and Receiving Goal-Anchored Critique",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Anchor design reviews explicitly on project goals (\"Does this make first-time billing obvious for non-accountants?\") rather than subjective whims (\"I prefer purple\"). When critiquing others, observe first, ask intent gently (\"What led to placing Filters on the right?\"), and tie suggestions straight to user comprehension or accessibility.",
