                        "Group related radio choices inside <fieldset><legend>.",
                        "Test submitting empty or malformed inputs using Tab and Enter only."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying Accessible Forms, Labels & Input States"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Adding explicit labels and type=\"email\" reduced form abandonment on phone screens by 29%.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Mobile Signup Drop-Off",
                      "takeaway": "Small form hygiene wins lift real completion rates."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Always keep persistent visible labels above fields so users remember requirements mid-edit.",
