                      "text": "Every engineering ticket needs Context, Clear Scope, Explicit Acceptance Criteria (verifiable pass/fail conditions), and Out-of-Scope boundaries. Maintain lightweight ADR/decision notes linking PRs so new teammates understand why architecture looks the way it does.",
