                    {
                      "text": "Silence in meetings followed by furious side-channel DMs signals unhealthy conflict avoidance. Catching minor friction within 48 hours via calm private curiosity (\"Noticed tight tension when Q3 ownership came up—want to unpack it early?\") stops small cracks from becoming formal HR disputes.",
