                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "text": "Calm Nervous-System Co-Regulation",
                      "type": "heading",
                      "level": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "When voices sharpen, match neither volume nor pace. Speak steadily and slightly slower, acknowledge genuine stress (\"Clearly both teams worked hard under tight limits here\"), and re-anchor to one concrete question. If hostility continues, call a brief neutral break: \"Let's pause ten minutes and return strictly focused on path forward.\"",
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "term": "Productive Time-Out",
                      "text": "Agreeing neutrally to take a 15-minute or 24-hour cooling pause with a locked return time so nobody storms off permanently.",
                      "type": "definition"
                    },
                    {
                      "body": "\"Both of us care deeply about shipping clean data; voices are heating up, so let's pause 15 minutes and reconvene at 2:30 to map options.\"",
                      "type": "example",
                      "title": "Resetting a Spiraling Call"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "steps",
                      "items": [
                        "Drop vocal speed and volume gently.",
                        "Never say \"Calm down!\"—it triggers instant irritation.",
                        "Lock an exact return timestamp whenever pausing."
                      ],
                      "title": "Applying De-Escalating Emotional Spikes Live"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "A structured 2-hour cooling break let two furious founders return calm enough to fix co-ownership gaps cleanly.",
                      "type": "case_study",
                      "title": "Cooling Off Saves Partnership",
                      "takeaway": "Timed pauses protect relationships without avoiding problems."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Show calm in your cadence and invite a break around \"protecting a fair decision\" instead.",
