                    },
                    {
                      "text": "When disagreeing upward, honor decision authority while presenting clear user/risk facts calmly: \"You hold final launch call; here is the regression risk our test uncovered so you decide with full visibility.\" Keep ego out, accept final call cleanly if safe and legal, and document shared agreement respectfully.",
